; Picture: the left door of the church in its second look (tiles $77-$7A)
;
; Draws a 1x4 picture of the door (tiles $77,$78,$79,$7A) at row 14, column 0, over the picture of #R$76A0: the church
; trigger #R$A615 alternates the two scripts at random intervals while sound 8 plays, so the shut door seems to
; rattle.
@label=DoorLeftRattle
b$76A8 DEFB $91,$77,$01,$04,$01,$0E,$00 ; PICTURES tiles from $77, 1x4, at 1 positions
 $76AF DEFB $80             ; END
